{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And they shall keep.</b> That they shall keep the days of the week, so as not to forget which day is the Sabbath, and that they shall prepare its needs and its ways on the sixth day, so that they may keep the Sabbath and not profane it." "Now the meaning of \"to do\" the Sabbath is like \"and he hastened to make it\" (Genesis 18:7)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:36.987830875Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}